# ==============================================================================
# Pramaan Frontend - Environment Configuration Template (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# When deploying to Vercel, NO environment variables are strictly required!
# Vercel rewrites in vercel.json automatically proxy /api/*, /oauth/*, and
# /.well-known/* requests to the EC2 backend at https://pramaan.anujacharjee.com.
#
# If you ever want to point the frontend to a custom API URL during local dev:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
